%% Reprise IDE - acknowledge to verdict (v3)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Developer
    participant V as Bug Reports view
    participant P as Pipeline
    participant AI as Provider (stub)
    participant W as Opened folder
    participant X as Runner or CI + adapter
    participant G as GitHub

    U->>V: Acknowledge report #N
    V->>P: start replication(#N)
    P->>G: fetch issue, attachments, earlier records
    P->>AI: intake(report)
    AI-->>P: fingerprint, platform, attempt_possible, question
    P->>P: score against earlier fingerprints
    opt candidate above threshold
        P->>AI: dedupe-confirm
        AI-->>P: same_bug + reason
    end
    alt user supplies a test
        U->>P: choose test file (validate)
    else provider supplies a test
        P->>AI: test(report, fingerprint)
        AI-->>P: test file + signature
        P->>U: show test in diff view, ask approval (PD-10)
        U-->>P: approve
        P->>W: write test file, record SHA-256
    end
    P->>X: run once on platform
    X-->>P: outcome
    P->>X: run trials per policy (min 10, max 20, early stop if all fail)
    X-->>P: outcomes
    P->>P: verdict + interval (statistics.md)
    opt CONFIRMED or FLAKY
        P->>AI: rootcause
        AI-->>P: summary, locations, direction
        P->>U: show diagnosis with evidence
        U-->>P: accept or edit diagnosis
    end
    P->>G: commit record to reprise-data (Git Data API)
    P-->>V: show verdict in Reprise panel
